        <item>
            <title>1.2.7</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 15:30:00 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>20</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>New "Remove watermark background" option: strips a solid/near-solid background from the watermark image itself at export time -- for watermarks that weren't prepared as a proper transparent PNG. Off by default. Available in the app (Watermark source section) and the wf-metadata CLI (--remove-background).</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
